# Unslop Design Rules

This project follows the **unslop** methodology. Every change must maintain the crafted quality.

## Token System (src/index.css:9-45)

All colors, spacing, radii, fonts go through `:root` tokens. Never use literal values.

```css
/* Colors */
--bg: #F7F3EB; --bg-subtle: #EFE9DD; --surface: #FFFDF9;
--text: #121212; --text-muted: #5A544A; --text-light: #7E766A;
--accent: #C8521A; --accent-hover: #B24310; --accent-light: #FCEFE7;

/* Spacing - 4px grid */
--radius-xs: 6px; --radius-sm: 10px; --radius-md: 16px; --radius-lg: 24px;

/* Typography */
--font-heading: 'Outfit', sans-serif; --font-body: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
--transition: 200ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
--transition-fast: 120ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
```

## Forbidden Patterns

| Pattern | Instead |
|---------|---------|
| `transition: all` | `transition: background-color var(--transition-fast), border-color var(--transition-fast)` |
| `hover:scale` / `translateY` on hover | Color/surface change only |
| `font-weight: 800/900` | `font-weight: 600` + size for hierarchy |
| `text-transform: uppercase` + `letter-spacing` | Sentence case, normal tracking |
| `#FFFFFF`, `rgba(...)` outside tokens | Use token variables |
| `9999px` border-radius everywhere | Nested radii scale (6-24px) |
| Emoji as icons | SVG from one set, text-role color |
| `animate-pulse`, `animate-ping` | Static, or purposeful motion only |
| Gradient text, colored glows, radial washes | Solid token colors, neutral shadows |

## Required Patterns

- **Spacing**: All values multiples of 4px (8, 12, 16, 20, 24, 28, 32, 40, 48, 56, 64, 80)
- **Radii**: Nested math — inner = outer - padding (min 4px)
- **Numbers**: `font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums` on all prices/counts
- **Focus**: `outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px;`
- **Icons**: 14-22px, 1.5-2px stroke, inherit text color
- **Copy**: No hype words, no trailing periods on labels/buttons, sentence case

## Accent Usage (Only 3 Places)

1. Primary action buttons (Order on WhatsApp, Save, Claim Deal)
2. Active navigation/item selection
3. Signature flame glyph: hero badge, WhatsApp button, hero pizza tag

## Direction Reference

- **Product**: Nairobi grill, WhatsApp ordering, 25-min delivery
- **Character**: Warm, artisanal, confident
- **World**: Flames, stone ovens, terracotta, hand-tossed dough
- **Moments**: Hero pizza photo (grounded), menu line illustrations
- **Signature**: Flame glyph in 3 places only

## Quality Check

Before committing, run mental checklist:
- [ ] No literal colors in component CSS
- [ ] All spacing on 4px grid
- [ ] No animated layout properties
- [ ] Weights 400-600 only
- [ ] No uppercase tracked labels
- [ ] No emoji in interface
- [ ] Accent only in 3 signature places
- [ ] Nested radii correct
- [ ] Tabular numbers on prices